WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.250
I have some video and audio for you today.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:07.830
That is truly the height of absurdity when
you talk about unelected people in positions

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:12.209
of power merely because they are related to
someone.

00:00:12.209 --> 00:00:14.549
Of course, our minds immediately should go.

00:00:14.549 --> 00:00:20.300
When I say that to Ivana Trump and her husband,
Jared Kushner, Donald Trump's son in law,

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.730
Jared Kushner, was interviewed by Time magazine
earlier this week, and he was asked, is it

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:29.600
possible, possible that the November election
could be postponed because of Corona virus?

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.940
Now, before I play the audio for you, the
question is fraught.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.300
The question is fraught because it's not really
up to the Trump administration.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:41.150
You'd have to move heaven and earth to do
it, but you could ask 50 states individually

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.400
to postpone their elections.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:47.530
And there's a question as to whether all states
would even be able to do it.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:52.040
But even if you managed to do that, you could
really only delay the November election a

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:57.440
few weeks, because in December, the electors
have to certify that election, unless you

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.510
can actually get well, would likely need to
be a constitutional change or maybe a Supreme

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.719
Court decision.

00:01:03.719 --> 00:01:07.390
It would be insanely difficult to actually
postpone the November election.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:12.180
It's also a fraught question because Jared
Kushner should have no involvement or opinion

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.180
about this at all.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:14.520
He's just Trump's son in law.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.460
He's been made an advisor, which is horrifying,
but OK.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.220
Jared Kushner is asked about this.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:25.560
Now, what I want to think about here is whether
this has been blown out of proportion, because

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:32.060
there have been a lot of apoplectic headlines
saying Jared Kushner is laying the groundwork

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:36.920
to postpone the presidential election or trying
to postpone the presidential election.

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:39.650
I don't know that that's the case necessarily
looking at the clip.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:40.650
Let's take a look at it.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:45.000
Is there any scenario, including a second
outbreak in the fall where the elections may

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.380
past November 3rd?

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.560
That's too far in the future to tell.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.360
Nothing that I'm aware of now.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:53.200
But again, our focus right now is just getting
the.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.450
Elections will happen on November 3rd.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.700
It's not my decision to make side.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.259
I'm not sure I can commit one way or the other.

00:02:00.259 --> 00:02:02.090
But right now, that's the plan.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:07.439
And again, hopefully by the time we get to
September, October, November, we've done enough

00:02:07.439 --> 00:02:11.230
work with testing and with and with all the
different things we're trying to do.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:15.120
So Jared says the plan is for November 3rd.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.260
I can't commit to it, but it's not his position
to commit.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:23.540
He has no power in when the election is held.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.850
Even Trump essentially has no power and when
the election is held.

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:31.000
So I actually do believe this was a little
bit blown out of proportion.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.770
There's another idea which is OK.

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:36.360
Jared can't do anything about it, but that's
why Jared said it.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.890
It's a trial balloon to gage reaction to it.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:40.900
If people go absolutely crazy.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:43.650
In the end, Jared has no say or involvement
in this.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.050
So it's no big deal.

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:51.720
On the other hand, if Jared Kushner were to
say something and the reaction to it is positive

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:55.550
or not that negative, then this could be actually
sort of a trial balloon.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.580
I just don't buy it.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:00.849
I think what happened here is that Jared Kushner's
wording is very clumsy.

00:03:00.849 --> 00:03:04.599
And what we're mostly reacting to is the fact
that Jared Kushner shouldn't be involved at

00:03:04.599 --> 00:03:06.860
all in anything that's going on.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:09.780
He shouldn't be answering questions about
when the election is going to be held.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:14.610
He should be barred by nepotism laws from
even being involved with this administration.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:20.900
Now, don't get me wrong, Donald Trump may
well be thinking of trying to move the election.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.930
He may end up trying to move the election.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.870
I just don't think Jared Kushner's comments
are the smoking gun.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:31.250
And I also don't believe Trump would succeed
in doing it now, in any case.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:36.440
This blew up and Jared Kushner ended up having
to put out a comment clarifying what he said.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:42.890
And he said, quote, I have not been involved
in nor am I aware of any discussions about

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:47.060
trying to change the date of the presidential
election.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:51.560
So for me, the story is not Jared Kushner
is floating, moving the election.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.709
To me, the story is why are people talking
to Jared Kushner?

00:03:54.709 --> 00:03:57.770
Why is Jared Kushner involved in things he
knows nothing about?

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.390
Jared Kushner has no authority.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:02.269
Trump doesn't even have the legal authority
to move the election.

00:04:02.269 --> 00:04:05.200
Are they trying to?

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.090
Are they likely the Trump administration?

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:10.299
Are they likely to try to do everything they
can to maintain power?

00:04:10.299 --> 00:04:16.629
Of course, voter suppression, disinformation,
propaganda, lying about their handling of

00:04:16.629 --> 00:04:21.339
Corona virus, lying about the state of the
economy, lying about Joe Biden, they're going

00:04:21.339 --> 00:04:27.759
to do what we would colloquially call trying
to rig the election in their favor.

00:04:27.759 --> 00:04:31.699
But it's not going to be Jared Kushner changing
election day.

00:04:31.699 --> 00:04:33.300
Now, what can we do?

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.340
Number one, don't fall for the propaganda.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:39.759
Number two, push states to adopt, vote by
mail.

00:04:39.759 --> 00:04:42.210
Number three, get people registered.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:46.470
Number four, obviously, make sure that you
vote.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:50.430
One less thing on postponing the election,
which I think is important.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.409
That and it should reduce the hysteria a little
bit.

00:04:53.409 --> 00:04:56.110
If the election is postponed.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.110
Imagine they succeed.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.110
Right.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.889
I don't see the path through it, but imagine
they succeed.

00:04:59.889 --> 00:05:04.180
And there is no new president to inaugurate
in January of 2021.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:08.199
I'm just thinking out loud here, the speaker
of the House becomes the president.

00:05:08.199 --> 00:05:10.029
Now, right now, that's Nancy Pelosi.

00:05:10.029 --> 00:05:12.399
Democratic Congresswoman Nancy Pelosi.

00:05:12.399 --> 00:05:19.719
I believe Trump will do anything that he can
to prevent Nancy Pelosi from becoming president

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:20.869
of the United States.

00:05:20.869 --> 00:05:25.960
Now, if you really want to get in the weeds,
you could have a situation where there's no

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.610
election in November.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:28.610
Imagine I don't think it's good.

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.770
But imagine there's no election in November.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:35.750
And because the election is postponed, you
don't even have enough Congress people to

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.349
have them in D.C. with a quorum to make.

00:05:39.349 --> 00:05:45.649
Nancy Pelosi, the president in that case,
is the next person in line becomes the next

00:05:45.649 --> 00:05:48.629
person in line to be president would be the
Senate president.

00:05:48.629 --> 00:05:50.439
Pro temp right now.

00:05:50.439 --> 00:05:51.960
That's Chuck Grassley.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:57.619
This obviously gets very dicey in that Republicans
would likely in that scenario try to prevent

00:05:57.619 --> 00:05:59.569
it from going to Nancy Pelosi.

00:05:59.569 --> 00:06:02.909
Skip over her and go to Grassley.

00:06:02.909 --> 00:06:04.990
I'm merely going through the motions here.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.619
I don't believe this would happen.

00:06:06.619 --> 00:06:11.429
But there is a scenario where the outcome
of Trump's postponing of the election makes

00:06:11.429 --> 00:06:14.960
Nancy Pelosi the president, until an election
is held.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:08:08.319
There's no way Trump is going to take any
action that would make

00:08:08.319 --> 00:08:14.430
that likely.

